subQuestions.prompt:
Given that universal set $M = \{1, 2, 3, \dots, 13\}$:
(i) list the prime numbers in $M$;
(ii) find the probability that an integer picked at random from $M$ is NOT a prime number.

The image of point $A(3, 4)$ under a translation vector $\mathbf{t}$ is $(-2, 9)$. Find:
(i) the translation vector $\mathbf{t}$;
(ii) the image $B'$ of point $B(-5, -4)$ when translated by $\mathbf{t}$.

Abena and Kwesi contributed GH¢ 12,000.00 and GH¢ 6,000.00 respectively to finance a business. They agreed that Kwesi will receive one-fourth of the net profit as manager, and the remaining profit will be shared in the ratio of their capital contributions. If the business made a net profit of GH¢ 16,000.00, calculate the total amount received by:
(i) Abena;
(ii) Kwesi.

